# TASK/LDG-M3 run B -- LDGDEMO.NAP driven by KEYBOARD shortcuts plus mouse
# only inside POPUP.NLD's pop-up. Reason: run A showed that every mouse click
# on the WinDom form is dropped -- evnt_multi reports EV_MB = 0 for a click
# that completed inside the double-click window (WinDom bclicks 258), and
# WinDom only acts on `evnt.mbut & 1` (evnt_windom.c:334). That is a kernel
# AES deviation from EmuTOS ev_rets/bchange (reported, not fixed here).
# WinDom's own keyboard path: Alt+<underlined letter> (frm_keybd_ev.c) and
# Return = DEFAULT object (frm_keyhd.c). POPUP.NLD's __popup waits with
# bclicks 1 and does not test the button word, so its clicks work.
# IKBD make codes: Alt 38, C 2E, F 21, Return 1C, Esc 01, '0' 0B, '.' 34,
# '5' 06; break = make | 0x80.
# Pop-up rows (popup opens at BUT_POPUP, x 329.., y 205..): Sinus y~237,
# Cosinus y~253.
